 "description": "CONFIRMED -> SHIPPED for a physical order (needs orders:write): tracking {carrier, number, url?} and delivery_eta (ISO 8601); stops the ship SLA. Later, call again with delivered_at to mark it DELIVERED (starts the refund window). The buyer sees the tracking in shop.order.get. Repeating is a no-op.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
